exports[`screen reader mode, through a reply, a tool, and a prompt 1`] = `
"JamCLI, project project, session <session>
You: read the notes
Tool read_file notes.txt, N ms, done
JamCLI: It says alpha.
You: remove them
Tool run_command rm notes.txt, asking














Permission needed: Allow run_command rm notes.txt?       Escape denies and stops
rm notes.txt
Default mode asks before tools that run commands.

1: Allow once
2: Allow this session   run_command(rm notes.txt) ...of 3, Up and Down change it
3: Allow this project   the same rule · .jamcli/config.local.json
4: Deny, continue
5: Deny with feedback
Status: default mode, ollama:fake-model, context N%, no sandbox, waiting
"
`;

